# Prompt Arena: Mystery — environment.
#
# The deployment (Vercel) needs:
#   SESSION_SECRET   signs team session cookies (required in production)
#   CODE_PEPPER      salts team-code hashes (required when code login is on)
#   DATABASE_URL     Postgres connection string (Vercel Postgres / Neon).
#                    Without it requests fall back to a per-instance /tmp
#                    SQLite file, which only suits a demo.
#
# Optional:
#   CODE_PEPPER / TEAM_CODES   "Team name=assigned-code,Another=code,..."
#   ALLOW_CODE_LOGIN=true      enables the team-code login endpoint
#   EVENT_MODE=true            disables guest/Google/practice, enables the
#                              event leaderboard + timing rules
#   ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD   the /admin/ control room (required in
#                              production; local development uses admin/arena-admin)
#   FULLSCREEN_ENFORCE=true|false     force fullscreen enforcement on or off
#                              (default: on for event mode / team-code play)
#   EXIT_GRACE_MS=10000        grace window to return before an exit is a strike
#   EXIT_MAX_STRIKES=3         strikes before automatic disqualification
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET             Google sign-in
#   GOOGLE_AUTH_URL / GOOGLE_TOKEN_URL / GOOGLE_USERINFO_URL   (override URLs)
#   LLM_BASE_URL / LLM_API_KEY / LLM_MODEL / LLM_FALLBACK_MODELS
#   LLM_EXTRA_HEADERS / LLM_MAX_CONCURRENT              optional AI suspects
#   OPENCODE_API_KEY  Zen key (https://opencode.ai/zen/v1) — fallback for
#                     LLM_API_KEY, and defaults LLM_BASE_URL to Zen when set.
#   LLM_CHARACTER_MODELS  JSON map character->model, e.g.
#     {"sameer":"big-pickle","parth":"space-bunny-free","veer":"exo-free"}
#   or per-character LLM_MODEL_SAMEER / LLM_MODEL_PARTH / ... overrides.
#   Built-in Zen free defaults (chat-completions only):
#     sameer=big-pickle, parth=space-bunny-free,
#     mother=longcat-2.5-preview-free, officer=step-5-preview-free,
#     veer=exo-free, enakshi=mimo-v2.6-flash-free, tanush=mimo-v2.5-free,
#     leader=ling-3.1-flash-free, ramu=nemotron-3-ultra-free
#   Fallbacks: nemotron-3.5-lightning-free, ling-3.0-flash-fin-free.
#
# Local development (`npm run dev:game`) works without any of these: it binds
# 127.0.0.1, enables code login, and stores progress in .game-dev.local.

SESSION_SECRET=change-me
CODE_PEPPER=change-me
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host/db
# ALLOW_CODE_LOGIN=true
# EVENT_MODE=false
# TEAM_CODES=TEAM-042=PANDA-7K2
